msgid "Image Adjustments"
msgstr "Axustes de imaxe"

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment.rst:18
msgid "The *Image Adjustment* video effects category provides effects and filter for changing the :term:`color matrix` and :term:`color space`, dealing with interlaced video sources and scale pixel art."
msgstr "A categoría de efectos de vídeo de *axuste de imaxe* fornece efectos e filtro para cambiar a :term:`matriz de cores <color matrix>` e o :term:`espazo de cores <color space>`, manexar fontes de vídeo entrelazadas e escalar arte pixelada."

